# PiWallet project context

## Repos

- **PiWallet** (this repo) — MkDocs site, store checkout UI (`docs/store/`, `docs/assets/store-*.js`). Branch `store-dev` for pilot. Status: `PILOT.md`.
- **piwalletsv-store** (`~/piwalletsv-store`, private) — Store Lambda, catalogs, tests. Ops: `store/OPERATOR.md`. Never copy store code into this public repo.
- **piwalletsv-infra** (`~/piwalletsv-infra`, private) — Terraform, deploy and publish scripts; packages `../piwalletsv-store/store`. Status: `PILOT.md`.
- **piwalletsv-pay** (`~/piwalletsv-pay`, private) — PiWallet Pay, separate from the store and site.

Dev: https://dev.piwalletsv.com · API: https://store.dev.piwalletsv.com

## Infrastructure rules

- **Terraform owns infrastructure** — do not tell the operator to create AWS resources in Console when Terraform module exists in piwalletsv-infra.
- **Manual only:** SSM secret values and registrar DNS (from `terraform output`).

## Docs / store UI

- BSV flow: `/store/checkout-bsv/` → verify email page → quote/pay. Publish with `./scripts/publish.sh site --env dev`.
- Resume work: read `PILOT.md` and `~/piwalletsv-infra/PILOT.md` before re-asking for context.
